格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"A DSH plugin that distinguishes official built-in DSH plugins and user custom plugins on the external interface.It can collect and manage all your previously created custom plugins 这是一个 DSH 插件管理插件，可在web界面区分 DSH 自带插件与自定义插件，并且能够收纳用户之前的自定义插件进行管理","id":"gh:1334919890","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-plugin-optimization","slug":"AJUbest/dsh-plugin-optimization","topics":["dsh","dsh-plugin","open-source","plugin-manager"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"A DSH plugin that distinguishes official built-in DSH plugins and user custom plugins on the externa"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"l interface.It can collect and manage all your previously created custom plugins 这是一个 DSH 插件管理插件，可在w"},{"id":"p1s3","text":"eb界面区分 DSH 自带插件与自定义插件，并且能够收纳用户之前的自定义插件进行管理"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# 🐋 dsh-plugin-optimization"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Plugin Manager for DeepSeek Harness · DSH 插件管理器**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Splits **Settings → Plugins** into **Built-in / Custom** partitions, with visual management, depende"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ncy auto-check & one-click repair, auto classification, auto-tidy and a **bilingual UI that follows "},{"id":"p4s3","text":"the DSH language instantly**."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Custom / Built-in partitions** — third-party plugins live in\n`~/.dsh/custom-plugins/`, clearly s"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"eparated from the official `@deepseek-ai/*`\npackages (which stay read-only).\n- **Browse folders** — "},{"id":"p6s3","text":"open the custom / built-in partition or any plugin\ndirectory in your file manager with one click.\n- "},{"id":"p6s4","text":"**Import** — paste a **git URL / local folder path / npm package name**;\nit is downloaded into the c"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"ustom partition and registered automatically.\n- **Register / Enable / Disable / Delete** — full life"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"cycle management.\n- **Auto-tidy (migration)** — plugins previously installed via\n`dsh plugin add` ar"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"e moved into the custom partition automatically after\nboot (one-time).\n- **8-category auto classific"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"ation** — color tags\n(MCP / Skill / Hook / Workflow / Model / UI / System / Security).\n- **Dependenc"},{"id":"p6s9","text":"y check & one-click repair** — detect missing / broken links /\nversion conflicts (the usual cause of"},{"id":"p6s10","text":" *\"plugin failed to start\"*) and\nrepair them with one click.\n- **Bilingual UI** — follows the DSH lo"},{"id":"p6s11","text":"cale instantly, no page refresh\n(even the settings tab label switches)."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Screenshot"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"> Requirements: Node.js and **pnpm** (`npm install -g pnpm` or `corepack enable pnpm`)."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Restart the gateway, then open **Settings → Plugins → Plugin Manager**."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"> Tip: restart twice after a fresh install so the auto-tidy fully applies."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- Host side (`lib/index.js`, Node built-ins only) registers JSON APIs via\n`ctx.webServer.register`:\n"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"`/plugins/dsh-plugin-optimization/api/{state,open,import,register,toggle,remove,migrate,deps/scan,de"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"ps/fix,...}`\n- Register / remove / migrate reuse the official `dsh plugin` CLI;\nenable/disable edits"},{"id":"p14s4","text":" `dsh.profile.bundles` (kept in sync with the plugin\nmarket) and cleans up legacy `cordis.patch.yml`"},{"id":"p14s5","text":" disable blocks.\n- Dependency check resolves against plugin dir → partition `node_modules` →\nprofile"},{"id":"p14s6","text":" → dsh install, matching real module resolution.\n- Security: same-host / loopback origins only; ever"},{"id":"p14s7","text":"y path is containment-checked."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Directory layout"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Uninstall"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
